## Database

This project includes the SQLModel + Alembic layer. Models live in
`src/{{ package_import_name }}/models.py`.

```bash
uv run botbase db revision -m "add a table"   # after editing models
uv run botbase db upgrade
```

During development `BOT_DATABASE__AUTO_CREATE=true` (the default) creates missing
tables on startup, so you can skip migrations until the schema settles.
